{"id":"e18t2","name":"Stock Value with Last Known Cost","lang":"pyspark","entry":"solve","params":["spark","moves_df"],"limit_s":30,"ordered":true,"desc":"<p>A warehouse records every stock movement in <code>moves_df</code>: <code>sku</code> (string), <code>moved_at</code> (timestamp), <code>qty</code> (integer, positive for an arrival, negative for a departure) and <code>unit_cost</code> (double, only filled on some rows, <code>null</code> otherwise).</p>\n<p>For each movement, the <b>known cost</b> is the last non null <code>unit_cost</code> of the same sku at or before this movement (in <code>moved_at</code> order). The <b>stock</b> after a movement is the sum of <code>qty</code> of this movement and of all the earlier movements of the sku.</p>\n<p>Your task is to return, for each sku and each day with at least one movement, the stock and its value at the end of the day: columns <code>sku</code>, <code>day</code> (date), <code>stock</code> (long) and <code>stock_value</code> (double, <code>stock * known cost</code> of the last movement of the day, rounded to 2 decimals, <code>null</code> when no cost is known yet), sorted by <code>sku</code>, then <code>day</code>. Two movements of a sku never have the same <code>moved_at</code>.</p>\n<h4>Example</h4><p><code>moves_df</code>:</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>sku</th><th>moved_at</th><th>qty</th><th>unit_cost</th></tr><tr><td>A</td><td>2026-03-01 08:00:00</td><td>10</td><td>null</td></tr><tr><td>A</td><td>2026-03-01 09:00:00</td><td>5</td><td>2.0</td></tr><tr><td>A</td><td>2026-03-01 17:00:00</td><td>-3</td><td>null</td></tr><tr><td>A</td><td>2026-03-03 10:00:00</td><td>-4</td><td>null</td></tr><tr><td>A</td><td>2026-03-03 11:00:00</td><td>20</td><td>2.5</td></tr><tr><td>B</td><td>2026-03-02 12:00:00</td><td>7</td><td>null</td></tr></table></div><p>the output should be</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>sku</th><th>day</th><th>stock</th><th>stock_value</th></tr><tr><td>A</td><td>2026-03-01</td><td>12</td><td>24.0</td></tr><tr><td>A</td><td>2026-03-03</td><td>28</td><td>70.0</td></tr><tr><td>B</td><td>2026-03-02</td><td>7</td><td>null</td></tr></table></div><div class=\"lim\"><b>[execution time limit]</b> 30 seconds (pyspark)<br><b>[memory limit]</b> 2 GB</div>","starter":"from pyspark.sql import SparkSession, DataFrame, functions as F\nfrom pyspark.sql.window import Window\n\n\ndef solve(spark: SparkSession, moves_df: DataFrame) -> DataFrame:\n    # write your code here\n    return moves_df\n","hints":[],"summary_fr":"","tags":["last ignorenulls","remplir vers l'avant","stock cumulé","dernière ligne par jour"],"minutes":20,"source":"Kata Lab","files":null,"visible":[{"input":{"moves_df":{"__df__":{"schema":"sku string, moved_at timestamp, qty int, unit_cost double","rows":[["A","2026-03-01 08:00:00",10,null],["A","2026-03-01 09:00:00",5,2.0],["A","2026-03-01 17:00:00",-3,null],["A","2026-03-03 10:00:00",-4,null],["A","2026-03-03 11:00:00",20,2.5],["B","2026-03-02 12:00:00",7,null]]}}},"expected":{"columns":["sku","day","stock","stock_value"],"rows":[["A","2026-03-01",12,24.0],["A","2026-03-03",28,70.0],["B","2026-03-02",7,null]]}},{"input":{"moves_df":{"__df__":{"schema":"sku string, moved_at timestamp, qty int, unit_cost double","rows":[["Z","2026-03-05 23:59:00",1,9.99],["Z","2026-03-06 00:01:00",1,null]]}}},"expected":{"columns":["sku","day","stock","stock_value"],"rows":[["Z","2026-03-05",1,9.99],["Z","2026-03-06",2,19.98]]}}],"hidden_n":6,"hidden":"","solution":""}